    "title": "MARIS-AI: Marine AI and Robotics for Innovation and Sustainability",
    "description": "Dear Colleagues, we are pleased to invite you, your colleagues and your students to the Second Edition of the two-day International Symposium “ MARIS-AI: Marine AI and Robotics for Innovation and Sustainability ”, at the interface of the Sorbonne Center for AI (SCAI) and the Ocean Institute at Sorbonne University Abu Dhabi. Date : January 20–21, 2027 Time : 9:00 AM – 3:30 PM Location : Sorbonne University Abu Dhabi Website : https://sites.google.com/view/maris-ai2027/ This year we have a Call for Paper with IEEE Xplore proceedings after the symposium. Feel free to share with your teams and your interested students. Program Highlights: Keynotes: Strategic perspectives on AI and robotics from distinguished international and regional speakers. Multidisciplinary Panels: A multidisciplinary dialogue on AI sustainability, international regulations, and GCC-wide cooperation for marine innovation, from academia, industry, and public institutions. Next-Gen Talent: A dedicated poster session and competition showcasing the work of students from BSc, MSc and PhD level. Important dates 15 October 2026: Abstract Submission 15 November 2026: Paper Submission (both for Talk and Poster) 10 December 2026: Paper Acceptance 31 December 2026: Camera Ready Paper submission 20-21 January 2027: 9am-17pm We look forward to welcoming you to Sorbonne University Abu Dhabi for the MARIS-AI symposium at the intersection of AI and Marine Science. Best regards, Giulia De Masi On behalf of the MARIS-AI Organizing Committee",
