    "title": "MINDSPRINT-2K26",
    "description": "MINDSPRINT 2K26 – National Level Hackathon MINDSPRINT 2K26 is a National Level Hackathon designed to bring together innovative minds from engineering colleges and institutions across India to solve real-world problems through technology, creativity, and collaborative problem-solving. The hackathon provides participants with a dynamic platform to transform innovative ideas into functional prototypes using emerging technologies such as Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Internet of Things, Cybersecurity, Cloud Computing, Data Science, Blockchain, and Web/Mobile Technologies . Participants will work in multidisciplinary teams to identify challenges, develop technology-driven solutions, build prototypes, and present their innovations before a panel of experts and industry professionals. The event emphasizes innovation, practical implementation, teamwork, design thinking, and entrepreneurship , encouraging students to move beyond conventional solutions and develop impactful products. MINDSPRINT 2K26 aims to connect students, academia, industry, technology enthusiasts, and innovators while providing participants with valuable exposure to real-world problem solving, mentorship, technical evaluation, and competitive innovation. The hackathon also serves as a platform for identifying promising ideas and nurturing them toward future projects, startups, research, and industry applications . Key Focus Areas Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Internet of Things & Embedded Systems Cybersecurity & Ethical Hacking Data Science & Analytics Cloud Computing Blockchain & Web3 Smart Applications & Automation Mobile and Web Technologies Sustainable and Social Innovation Open Innovation MINDSPRINT 2K26 – Imagine. Innovate. Build. Transform.",
