    "title": "2nd International Conference on Frontiers Technology in Circuits and Systems (FTCS 2026)",
    "description": "The 2nd International Conference on Frontiers Technology in Circuits and Systems (FTCS 2026) will be held from November 20-22, 2026, in Chongqing, China. Following the success of the inaugural FTCS 2025—which was successfully held and whose proceedings have been published in IEEE Xplore—we are pleased to continue this series. FTCS 2026, co-organized by Chongqing University and IEEE Circuits and Systems Society Chongqing Chapter, aims to further strengthen the platform for researchers, engineers, and practitioners to present their latest work and exchange ideas in the evolving field of circuits and systems. FTCS 2026 will continue to focus on the frontier hotspots and core directions of circuits and systems, with thematic focus spanning integrated circuits, biomedical electronics, artificial intelligence technologies and their interdisciplinary integration. Topics of Interest include, but are not limited to: &bull; Integrated Circuits and Systems &bull; Biomedical Electronics and Systems &bull; Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning Technologies &bull; Smart Sensors and IoT &bull; Emerging Applications and Interdisciplinary Research Conference Website: https://www.ic-ftcs.org/ Submission System: https://cmt3.research.microsoft.com/FTCS2026 Submission Due: July 24, 2026",
