    "title": "IEEE GrowForward Alabama Section - Students and Grad Students",
    "description": "GrowForward – Student and Grad Student Event Tech Explorers Bootcamp Ready to chart your path in the world of technology? Join us for the Tech Explorers Bootcamp , an exciting and interactive event designed for IEEE undergraduate and graduate students who are eager to explore, connect, and grow. This engaging experience introduces you to the power of IEEE and helps you navigate your academic and professional journey with confidence. Discover what IEEE is, why it matters, and how becoming a member can unlock opportunities in leadership, innovation, and career development. Dive into a hands-on robotics activity that brings technology to life and get inspired by fellow students and IEEE members. You’ll also hear from Member and Industry Professionals as they share their IEEE journeys, lessons learned, and practical advice, followed by an open Q&A session where you can ask questions and gain valuable insights. The roundtable format encourages active participation through group discussions , where attendees can share common research interests, explore collaboration opportunities , and even begin forming study groups or project teams . Whether you're just getting started or looking to get more involved, this bootcamp provides a supportive space to learn, connect, and take action . Explore membership opportunities, upcoming events, and ways to stay engaged , all while building meaningful connections with your peers. Join us to navigate your future, expand your possibilities, and become part of a global community of innovators . Date: 14 Nov 2026 Time: 09:00 AM EST to 07:00 PM EST",
