    "description": "The IEEE ENSAF Student Branch Executive Committee held its first EXCOM meeting to define the strategic direction for the 2026–2027 term. The committee agreed on three guiding pillars for the year: IEEE global value, learning, and community engagement. Members reviewed and approved the annual activity roadmap, discussed membership value and fee justification, and identified IEEE Day and IEEEXtreme as the highest-priority events. The meeting also covered plans for the Integration Day and Integration Trip, including initiatives to strengthen the branch's identity and improve the onboarding process for new members. Finally, the Executive Committee agreed to maintain a balanced approach throughout the year by aligning branch activities with members' academic commitments while fostering teamwork and delivering high-quality programs.",
