    "title": "Certificate Distribution Ceremony",
    "description": "The IEEE GTB4CEC Student Branch organized a Certificate Distribution Ceremony on 28th January, 2026, to recognize the dedication, teamwork, and innovative spirit displayed by the students who participated in IEEEXtreme 19.0 and those who qualified for the Internal Smart India Hackathon (SIH 2025). Faculty members appreciated the efforts of all participants and encouraged them to continue enhancing their technical and problem-solving skills. Certificates were awarded to acknowledge their hard work and active involvement. The Smart India Hackathon (SIH) Internal Round was successfully conducted on 16th September 2025 in the institution. The event witnessed enthusiastic participation from students across various branches, who presented innovative ideas and practical solutions to real-world problem statements. Teams showcased creativity, technical knowledge, and strong problem-solving skills during their presentations. Faculty members evaluated the projects based on originality, feasibility, and impact. The internal hackathon round provided students with a valuable platform to collaborate, enhance their technical abilities, and prepare for the national-level Smart India Hackathon competition. IEEEXtreme 19.0, held on 25th October 2025, was the 19th edition of the global 24-hour competitive programming challenge organized annually by the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE). In that event, teams of IEEE student members worked continuously for a full day and submitted solutions to a set of increasingly difficult algorithmic and real-world coding problems, gaining practical experience in logic, teamwork, and problem-solving. The competition attracted thousands of students, fostering a spirit of healthy competition, global networking, and peer learning. In conclusion, the Certificate Distribution Ceremony successfully acknowledged the efforts and achievements of students who participated in IEEE Xtreme 19.0 and those who qualified for SIH Internal 2025. The event not only celebrated their accomplishments but also reinforced the importance of innovation, teamwork, perseverance, and the spirit of problem-solving. The ceremony ended on a positive and inspiring note, encouraging participants to strive for excellence in future academic and professional endeavors.",
